Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 23:26:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Kiteline dashboard gaps: live polling, status dots,
 kitchen data

Replace corrupted ?? status markers with CSS dots, seed workflows per
kitchen so the site switcher changes Happening Now/overdue, add task
detail Open modal, working pagination controls, notification dropdown,
richer Ctrl+K search, 30s live refresh, and clock-session merge on
hydrate so clock-in survives refresh.
